From 70fd2a6156d81b7992cee6326c3dd1c07b1cfdd2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 17:03:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 13/59] render.xvt_cockpit: X-Wing panel text and CMD rows as
 in XvT

X-Wing only (XwXvtCockpit_PanelText):
- The empty craft name box in the lower left of XWING12 is filled with its
  own dark interior.
- XvT's panel text at its own .int positions: E/L/S under the power bars,
  F/R beside the shield switch, the mission clock, throttle (capped at
  100%) and speed readouts with THROTTLE and SPEED captions. X-Wing's clock
  and max speed panes and its weapon icon (elements 23-26) are hidden.
- CMD: range centred on the last row, orders on the left and their target
  or the cargo on the right of the row above; no speed/throttle row.
- The CMD header and 3D model drawing are shared helpers.
---
